##
    A book, and what a shelf can be asked about one.

    Nothing here knows there is a lending desk. That is the point of putting it in a
    project of its own: it can be built, read, and reused without the program that happens to
    use it today.

    Public, because Library is meant to use it. A type written with no visibility reaches its
    own project and no further, which is why Wording beside it stays inside Books however many
    projects reference this one.
##

# @summary: A book on a shelf, and how many copies are left of it.
public model Book

    # @summary: What the book is called.
    string title;

    # @summary: Who wrote it.
    string author;

    # @summary: How many are on the shelf right now.
    integer copies;

    # @summary: Puts a book on the shelf.
    # @title: what it is called.
    # @author: who wrote it.
    # @copies: how many there are.
    public function Book(string title, string author, integer copies)
        this.title = title;
        this.author = author;
        this.copies = copies;
    end function

    # @summary: What the book is called.
    # @yields: the title.
    public string function Title()
        yield this.title;
    end function

    # @summary: Who wrote it.
    # @yields: the author's name.
    public string function Author()
        yield this.author;
    end function

    # @summary: How many are on the shelf.
    # @yields: the number left.
    public integer function Copies()
        yield this.copies;
    end function

    # @summary: Whether one can be borrowed.
    # @yields: true while at least one copy is left.
    public boolean function IsAvailable()
        yield this.copies > 0;
    end function

    # @summary: Takes one copy off the shelf.
    # @throws: ArgumentException where none is left to take.
    public function Lend()
        if this.copies <= 0
            throw new ArgumentException();
        end if

        this.copies = this.copies - 1;
    end function

    # @summary: The book written out as one line.
    # @yields: the title and author joined for reading.
    public string function Described()
        yield Wording.Join(this.title, this.author);
    end function

end model
